<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DevOps Learning | Virtual TechBox</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-header" id="home">
        <nav class="navbar container" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a class="brand" href="#home">
                <span class="brand-mark">VT</span>
                <span>Virtual <strong>TechBox</strong></span>
            </a>

            <div class="nav-links">
                <a class="active" href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
            </div>

            <a class="nav-button" href="#dashboard">Explore</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="container hero-content">
                <span class="eyebrow">LEARN · BUILD · GROW</span>
                <h1>Your journey into <span>DevOps</span> starts here.</h1>
                <p>Build practical skills, explore modern tools, and take the next step in your cloud and DevOps learning journey.</p>
                <a class="primary-button" href="#dashboard">Go to Dashboard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-decoration" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="decoration-circle circle-one"></div>
                <div class="decoration-circle circle-two"></div>
                <div class="terminal-card">
                    <div class="terminal-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                    <p><span>$</span> learn-devops</p>
                    <p class="terminal-success">Ready to get started ✓</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="dashboard section" id="dashboard">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div>
                        <span class="eyebrow">YOUR LEARNING SPACE</span>
                        <h2>Dashboard</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p>A simple place to explore what you can learn next.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="dashboard-grid">
                    <article class="info-card">
                        <div class="card-icon purple">⌘</div>
                        <h3>DevOps Fundamentals</h3>
                        <p>Understand the culture, practices, and workflow behind modern DevOps.</p>
                        <a href="#about">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    </article>

                    <article class="info-card">
                        <div class="card-icon blue">☁</div>
                        <h3>Cloud & Infrastructure</h3>
                        <p>Explore cloud platforms, servers, networking, and infrastructure basics.</p>
                        <a href="#about">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    </article>

                    <article class="info-card">
                        <div class="card-icon green">▣</div>
                        <h3>Tools & Automation</h3>
                        <p>Get familiar with containers, CI/CD, and tools that automate delivery.</p>
                        <a href="#about">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section section" id="about">
            <div class="container about-content">
                <div>
                    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS SPACE</span>
                    <h2>Learn something.<br><span>Build something.</span></h2>
                </div>
                <p>Virtual TechBox is a learning space for people interested in DevOps, cloud computing, and technology. Keep exploring, practise regularly, and grow one step at a time.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="container footer-content">
            <a class="brand footer-brand" href="#home">
                <span class="brand-mark">VT</span>
                <span>Virtual <strong>TechBox</strong></span>
            </a>
            <p>Keep learning. Keep building.</p>
            <span class="copyright">© 2026 Virtual TechBox</span>
        </div>
    </footer>
